  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily is in the park. Her family is here. May is Lily's friend. May and her father come. \"Hello, May!\" says Lily. \"Hello, Lily!\" says May. \"Hello!\" says May's father.",
      "The ball is under a tree. \"Please get the ball,\" says Lily. May gets the ball. \"Here you are!\" says May. \"Thank you!\" says Lily. Lily throws the ball. Oh no! It hits Tom. \"Sorry, Tom!\" says Lily. \"Don't worry!\" says Tom.",
      "It is the end. Is it fun? Yes, it is! \"Goodbye, May!\" says Lily. \"Goodbye, Lily!\" says May. \"See you!\" says Tom."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily's family meets May and her father in the park. They play with a ball and say hello, please, thank you, sorry, and goodbye.",
